{{JPExclusive}}
'''Li'l Clops Cat Egg''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained by purchasing it from a special sale during the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 9.9 Update|Version 9.9]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]] gains a 20% chance to perform a [[Savage Blow]].

