==Trivia==
*Li'l Clops Cat Egg, [[Li'l Tank Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Tank Cat]], [[Wafer Cat (Special Cat)|Wafer Cat]], [[PAC-MAN (Special Cat)|PAC-MAN]] and the [[:Category:Ancient Eggs|Ancient Eggs]] have the lowest range of any Cat Unit, barring the unobtainable [[Cheetah Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Cheetah Cat]].
*Excluding immobile cats (such as the [[Ototo Corps#Iron Wall|Iron Wall Cat]]), Li'l Clops Cat Egg is the slowest Cat Unit in the game, tied with [[Mighty Kristul Muu (Legend Rare Cat)|Mighty Kristul Muu]] and [[Freshman Cat Jobs (Super Rare Cat)|Freshman Cat Jobs]].
*Despite being exclusive to [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and BCTW, the English name of this unit can be found in the game files.
*Li'l Clops Cat Egg's evolution is a nod to how units in Castle & Dragon are unlocked by hatching eggs.
*He is the first [[:Category:IAP Cats|IAP Cat]] to get a True Form.

